# Core upgrade migrations
#
# Idempotent, non-destructive migrations that bring an INSTALLED site from a
# released version to the next one. Run by `gp247:core-update` (and therefore by
# `gp247:update`) via `migrate --path`, never by the create-tables migration in
# the parent folder.
#
# Contract: ADR compat-foundation_public-release-migration-policy (P1-P4),
# NFR-MAINT-breaking-change-migration. Every breaking schema OR data-semantics
# change released from v2.2 onward must ship a file here (or in the front/shop
# equivalent) so an installed site converts automatically.
#
# This placeholder keeps the folder present in git while it is empty, so the
# `migrate --path` above resolves instead of failing on a missing directory.
